  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clean energy initatives for households in the Dang District</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepal has 45 per cent of forest coverage, but the forest quality is being degraded due to immense pressure on the forest for communities&#x2019; energy requirement. Therefore, the project set up a model to fulfil communities&apos; energy needs and improve forest quality. The installation of 200 biogas plants reduced greenhouse gas emissions and provided house-holds with clean energy. In addition, the project restored 100 hectares of ten community forests to ensure a growing carbon stock. Trainings in sustainable forest management were held to ensure the sustainability of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
